### Admin hot update model under existing provider
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/providers/deepseek/models/deepseek-test
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "upstreamModel": "deepseek-v4-flash",
  "inputPricePer1k": 0.0,
  "outputPricePer1k": 0.0
}

### Admin hot update route
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/routes/deepseek-test
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "primary": "deepseek:deepseek-test",
  "fallbacks": [
    "deepseek:deepseek-v4-flash"
  ]
}

### Admin evaluation snapshot
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/eval
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}

### Admin upsert prompt version
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/eval/prompt-versions
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "gateway-answer",
  "version": "v1",
  "model": "deepseek-v4-flash",
  "parameters": {
    "temperature": 0.2
  },
  "template": "请基于上下文回答问题，并指出依据。"
}

### Admin upsert retrieval strategy
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/eval/retrieval-strategies
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "default-rag",
  "embeddingModel": "bge-m3",
  "vectorStore": "milvus",
  "topK": 5,
  "scoreThreshold": 0.6,
  "rerank": true
}

### Admin upsert golden case
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/eval/golden-dataset
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "LLM Gateway 的核心价值是什么？",
  "groundTruth": "统一接入、路由、限额、缓存、成本统计、观测和安全治理。",
  "contexts": [
    "LLM Gateway 统一封装多模型调用，并提供路由、fallback、限额和成本治理。"
  ],
  "tags": ["gateway", "cost"]
}

### Admin run regression
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/eval/regression-runs
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "promptVersionId": "gateway-answer-v1",
  "retrievalStrategyId": "default-rag",
  "answerByQuestion": {
    "LLM Gateway 的核心价值是什么？": "统一接入多模型，提供路由、限额、缓存、成本和观测治理。"
  }
}

### Upsert a versioned LLM Judge rubric
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/eval/judge-rubrics
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "gateway-rag-v1",
  "name": "LLM Gateway RAG 质量量表",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "instructions": "重点检查答案是否基于上下文，以及是否正确说明网关治理能力。",
  "passScore": 75,
  "dimensions": [
    {"name":"correctness","description":"事实和结论正确","weight":0.35,"minimumScore":70},
    {"name":"faithfulness","description":"关键主张有上下文支持","weight":0.30,"minimumScore":75},
    {"name":"relevance","description":"直接回答问题","weight":0.15,"minimumScore":65},
    {"name":"completeness","description":"覆盖关键要求","weight":0.10,"minimumScore":60},
    {"name":"safetyCompliance","description":"遵守安全和合规边界","weight":0.10,"minimumScore":80}
  ]
}

### Run candidate generation, two Judges and conditional arbitration
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/eval/judge-runs
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "candidateModel": "deepseek-v4-flash",
  "caseIds": [],
  "rubricId": "gateway-rag-v1",
  "promptVersionId": "gateway-answer-v1",
  "retrievalStrategyId": "default-rag",
  "candidateAnswers": {},
  "metadata": {"source":"idea-http-client"}
}

> {% client.global.set("judgeRunId", response.body.id); %}

### Apply deterministic CI quality gate to the Judge run
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/eval/judge-runs/{{judgeRunId}}/quality-gate
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minAverageScore": 75,
  "minPassRate": 0.90,
  "maxArbitrationRate": 0.50,
  "maxFailedCases": 0
}

### User downvote; use the X-Request-Id of a completed chat request
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "replace-with-chat-request-id",
  "rating": "DOWN",
  "reason": "遗漏了 fallback 触发条件",
  "expectedAnswer": "答案应说明超时、限流、熔断和上游异常如何触发 fallback。",
  "userId": "demo",
  "metadata": {"source":"idea-http-client"}
}

### Online evaluation governance snapshot
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/eval/governance
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}

### Manually judge a sample from the sample pool
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/eval/governance/samples/replace-with-request-id/judge
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}

### Confirm a medium-confidence sample as Bad Case
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/eval/governance/samples/replace-with-request-id/review
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "CONFIRM_BAD_CASE",
  "reviewer": "qa-reviewer",
  "rootCause": "Prompt 没有要求说明 fallback 的触发边界",
  "expectedAnswer": "需要覆盖超时、限流、熔断和上游异常。",
  "notes": "确认生成 Golden 候选"
}

### Approve Golden candidate; high-risk candidate requires expertApproval=true
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/eval/governance/golden-candidates/replace-with-candidate-id/review
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "APPROVE",
  "reviewer": "domain-expert",
  "standardAnswer": "经专家确认的标准答案",
  "notes": "证据与业务规则核对通过",
  "expertApproval": true
}

